# --- Excluded: separate / third-party git repos (not part of this sample's own work) ---
# Reference-only repos — never re-published here
reference-repos/
# Separate AI-DLC workflows repo (its own git remote)
aidlc-workflows/
# Unrelated exploratory project — not part of this sample
ideation-portal/
# Upstream open-source PHP sources are NOT committed here — this is third-party code we migrated
# FROM, not code we wrote, and it triggers SAST findings (e.g. Semgrep insecure-innerhtml) that
# are not actionable against this repo. See README.md "Source Applications" table for each app's
# URL + exact pinned commit SHA + clone instructions so any reviewer can fetch the exact baseline
# used for parity if they need to compare against it.
#   symfony-demo-migration/source-php  -> https://github.com/symfony/demo
#   sylius-doctrine-sample/source-php  -> https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius
#   laravel-eloquent-sample/source-php -> https://github.com/BookStackApp/BookStack
**/source-php/
# Same for upstream clones under Transform/apps (Sylius, Symfony Demo) — Transform/ is a separate
# exploratory spec area, not part of the two completed migrations
Transform/apps/

# --- Build artifacts & runtime state ---
**/target/
*.class
*.jar
!**/mvnw*.jar
!**/.mvn/wrapper/*.jar
**/data/*.sqlite
*.log
build.log

# --- OS / IDE noise ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.iml
.idea/
